If you want a build that carries no Sony artwork, the original hand-drawn
vector icon set is still in the source and nothing was deleted when the PS3 art
went in: XmbIcons.category() and XmbIcons.glyph() return it, alongside the
XmbIcons.categoryRes() and XmbIcons.glyphRes() lookups that point at the PNGs.


